bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    crash_handler_and_fork_bridge_absent_from_seed_macos_2026-09-06, 0, "Registration of unresolved tracking document. Priority: untriaged; P3 is a registration placeholder. The document remains the authority for diagnosis, ownership, and acceptance; this row does not claim implementation or closure."
    crash_handler_and_fork_bridge_absent_from_seed_macos_2026-09-06, 1, "2026-11-26 fix-implemented-verification-pending: audit of manual-successor-v14/simple (Core-C Stage-3 macOS arm64) showed rt_fork_* present but rt_install_crash_handler absent because Core-C excludes runtime.c and runtime_native.c lacked rt_install_crash_handler and its spl_init_args startup call. Shared crash handler extracted to src/runtime/runtime_crash_handler_impl.h and wired into both runtime.c (SPL_RUNTIME_NATIVE_TWIN) and runtime_native.c (strong + spl_init_args). Darwin regression test test/01_unit/runtime/rt_fork_crash_handler_darwin_test.shs passes 24/24 checks on both Core-C (strict link) and legacy runtime.c; compiled crash_bundle_spec.spl on a rebuilt Stage-4 macOS binary pending P4 qualification."

